{"id":"faculty-shubhangi_nema:e0011","type":"paragraph","page":1,"text":"Prior to joining IIIT-NR, I served as a Principal Project Scientist at IIT Delhi, where I worked on a research project funded by the Indian Council of Medical Research (ICMR), New Delhi. I received my Ph.D. in Systems and Control Engineering from IIT Bombay. I am also a recipient of the prestigious Prime Minister’s Research Fellowship (PMRF), awarded to outstanding research scholars pursuing doctoral research at Centrally Funded Technical Institutes (CFTIs). I actively contribute to the research community as a reviewer for several IEEE and IFAC conferences and leading journals published by Springer and Wiley and invited for talks in many prestigious institutes of national importance.","bbox":null,"level":null,"table":null,"reader":"markdown","confidence":null,"order":0,"attrs":{},"status":"extracted","reasons":[]}
